      <title>个人博客的搭建</title>
      <link href="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/"/>
      <url>/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="1-安装"><a href="#1-安装" class="headerlink" title="1 安装"></a>1 安装</h1><blockquote><p>参考来源：<br> <a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yb411a7ty/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&vd_source=f4f7882467863f04f4cfb3a40b8af176">手把手教你从0开始搭建自己的个人博客 |无坑版视频教程| hexo_哔哩哔哩_bilibili</a><br> <a href="https://techniquenotes.github.io/2024/02/20/Hexo/Hexo%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B%EF%BC%88%E4%BA%8C%EF%BC%89/">Hexo 博客搭建教程（二） | TechNotes</a></p></blockquote><ul><li>下载地址：<a href="https://nodejs.org/zh-cn">Node.js — 在任何地方运行 JavaScript</a></li><li>一直next，安装完成</li><li>验证：在cmd中输入 node -v， 出现版本即可（npm也一起安装进来了）<img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/Pasted_image_20250323211812.png" class=""></li></ul><p>给npm换一个镜像源：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">npm install -g cnpm --registry-https://registry.npm.taobao.org</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 验证</span><br><span class="line">cnpm</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>安装hexo</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cnpm install -g hexo-cli</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/Pasted_image_20250323214050.png" class=""><p>进入对应创建的blog目录，初始化 hexo</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo init</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/Pasted_image_20250323214737.png" class=""><p>安装完成，开启。在4000端口</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo s</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/Pasted_image_20250323214916.png" class=""><p>进去看一看捏，神不神奇：</p><img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/Pasted_image_20250323215102.png" class=""><h1 id="2-hexo-操作"><a href="#2-hexo-操作" class="headerlink" title="2 hexo 操作"></a>2 hexo 操作</h1><p>创建新文档：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo new</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>生成</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo g</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>部署</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">hexo d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="3-部署到github"><a href="#3-部署到github" class="headerlink" title="3 部署到github"></a>3 部署到github</h1><p>创建新仓库（听说必须是这个名字）：&lt;用户名&gt;.github.io</p><p>在hexo上安装插件：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cnpm install --save hexo-deployer-git</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/Pasted_image_20250323220711.png" class=""><p>修改文件 _config.yml</p><img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/Pasted_image_20250323221206.png" class=""><p>部署：</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"># windows 需要操作</span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.email &quot;xxx&quot; </span><br><span class="line">git config --global user.name &quot;xxx&quot;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"># 部署</span><br><span class="line">hexo d</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="4-加载图片"><a href="#4-加载图片" class="headerlink" title="4 加载图片"></a>4 加载图片</h1><ol><li>修改配置文件 <code>_config.yml</code> 中的配置 <code>post_asset_folder</code> 为 <code>true</code></li><li>此时新加博客会自动创建一个同名文件夹</li></ol><img src="/2025/03/23/%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E5%8D%9A%E5%AE%A2%E7%9A%84%E6%90%AD%E5%BB%BA/image.png" class="" title="alt text"><ol start="3"><li>在文章中添加图片，使用相对路径 <code>&#123;% asset_img "image.png" "" %&#125;</code></li><li>清空一下之前生成图片失败的，<code>hexo clean</code></li><li>重新生成 <code>hexo g</code></li></ol><blockquote><p>解析：<br>之前生成失败，看hexo g后生成的publish文件夹，和网页中获取的图片路径不对应，所以需要重新生成。（反正最后的期望就是让图片的路径能加载到）</p></blockquote><h1 id="5-更换主题"><a href="#5-更换主题" class="headerlink" title="5 更换主题"></a>5 更换主题</h1><h2 id="安装"><a href="#安装" class="headerlink" title="安装"></a>安装</h2><p>选择一个自己喜欢的主题，我这里选择 Butterfly。</p><p>安装教程有：<a href="https://butterfly.js.org/posts/21cfbf15/">https://butterfly.js.org/posts/21cfbf15/</a></p><p>根据上面安装即可，好像木有难点。</p><h2 id="进阶"><a href="#进阶" class="headerlink" title="进阶"></a>进阶</h2><p>谁不想配好看点呢？</p><p>参考网站：<a href="https://blog.csdn.net/mjh1667002013/article/details/129290903">https://blog.csdn.net/mjh1667002013/article/details/129290903</a></p><p>先放这里，还没有具体实践。</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
